-Use the existing Wire Contour condition field for both qualities. Keep AGIE_QN2 as the original Ra 0.30 µm selection. AGIE_BERCO_RA035 requests the documented Fine+ tuple from the MIT Agie Processor quality presets. Both condition rows require the existing preview gap and wire diameter. The normal project file preserves the selected condition.
